  {
    "type": "summary",
    "content": "The 0.27 panels layout: the CloudSurf app's arrangement as SurfDoc source —\nthe Navbar rail, a navigator seat plus a pinned Surfy seat, four Desks and\nthe ten presets. Rendered at 390 / 834 / 1280 to pin the per-class slot set."
